<title>BELGIUM: EU holds molasses import duties at same level.</title>
<headline>EU holds molasses import duties at same level.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee kept molasses import duties unchanged, despite slightly lower reference prices, an EU official said  on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee set the tariffs unchanged from last week but with slight falls in the reference prices,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The duty for cane molasses remains at the GATT maximum of 0.41 Ecus per 100 kg based on a new reference price of 7.50 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 7.65 Ecus last week.</p>
<p>Beet duty remains at zero based on a reference price of 11.42 Ecus per 100 kg compared with 11.43 last week.</p>
</text>
